==Trivia==
* Pokémon Hills was used as the [[Original Trainer|OT]] of Japanese and English [[Pokémon Hills Mewtwo|Mewtwo]] distributed for {{game|Black and White|s}} and [[Pokémon Black and White Versions 2|Black 2 and White 2]] in Japan, Taiwan, Indonesia, and the Philippines, a reference to the sixteenth movie {{OBP|Mewtwo|M16}} from ''[[Pokémon the Series: Black & White]]'' in Pokémon Hills.
===Origin===
Pokémon Hills is based on {{wp|Central Park}} in {{wp|New York City}}.

